    "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:04:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-11T18:04:03Z",
    "body": "I agree with Anusha's rationale, I think it makes more sense to keep Max-Age's units consistent across HTTP and script cookies. `expires` is already expected to support different types than `maxAge` so I do not think there is a need to couple their units.",
