    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T20:19:40Z",
    "body": "Ok, if you don't feel too strongly, I think I would prefer seconds since it aligns with the HTTP and document.cookie APIs and I think anne mentioned that any additional granularity provided by milliseconds would likely not even be impactful given networking time? \n\n(can keep this open till we make a PR that the maxAge should be in seconds) Feel free to follow up on this if you disagree or if there is any more context that you think should sway this a different way? ",
